        "body": "Fighters square up from neighbouring cells instead of sharing one\n\nA dwarf and a monster stepping toward each other at the same time both\nmoved into the cell between them and fought there, the dwarf hiding the\nmonster. Now a melee fighter whose foe is part-way through a step into\nits reach waits for it, and a monster that ends up in its prey's own cell\nbacks off a step before it strikes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0172Bktxac5eUT4t3gCW9ZoH\n",
